    "sections": {
        "description": "Candles Shop is a beautifully designed and elegant theme tailored for candle retailers, boutique owners, and handmade product businesses looking to build a professional online shop. Ideal for showcasing handmade candles, decorative candles, aromatherapy products, scented collections, and gift items, this theme offers a clean and visually appealing layout that enhances product presentation and customer engagement. Fully compatible with WooCommerce, it enables easy management of product listings, pricing, inventory, and online sales, while integration with Contact Form 7 streamlines customer inquiries and orders, and Yoast SEO helps improve search visibility for keywords like online candle store and candle shop. With customizable layouts, color options, and typography settings, users can effortlessly match their brand identity. The responsive design ensures a smooth shopping experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, while its SEO-friendly and performance-optimized structure supports better rankings and faster loading. Candles Shop is a perfect solution for creating a beautiful, shop-focused, and high-performing online store that helps businesses showcase their collections, attract customers, and grow efficiently."
    },
